{"title":"Congruence (modular arithmetic)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Congruence</b> in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equivalence_class\" title=\"Equivalence class\">equivalence class</a> which takes the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder\" title=\"Remainder\">remainder</a> when divided by a specific number, called a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modulus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modulus\">modulus</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Congruence_(modular_arithmetic)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">Modular arithmetic</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Congruence_(modular_arithmetic)&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018081329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 13/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 334/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.055      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.055      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31390:|#|:idhas